{"path":"symbol_index/numbers","title":"std::numbers Symbol Index","titleHtml":"std::numbers Symbol Index","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/symbol_index/numbers","section":"symbol_index","kind":"index","summary":"This page tries to list all the symbols that are available from the standard library (numerics library) in the namespace std::numbers.","html":"<p>This page tries to list all the symbols that are available from the <a href=\"/w/cpp/standard_library\">standard library</a> (<a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric\">numerics library</a>) in the namespace <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">numbers</span></span></code>. The symbols are written as follows:\n</p>\n<ul><li> Function names with <code>()</code>.\n</li><li> Templates with <code>&lt;&gt;</code>.\n</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"E_I_L_P_S\"><blockquote><code><a href=\"#E\">E</a>  <a href=\"#I\">I</a>  <a href=\"#L\">L</a>  <a href=\"#P\">P</a>  <a href=\"#S\">S</a></code></blockquote></h2>\n<h3 id=\"E\">E</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\"><code>e</code></a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span><br>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\"><code>e_v</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span><br>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\"><code>egamma</code></a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span><br>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\"><code>egamma_v</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span><br>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"I\">I</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\"><code>inv_pi</code></a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span><br>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\"><code>inv_pi_v</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class